  "corrected_scoring": {
    "primary": "post-cooldown eval: a linear cooldown of 24 steps (13.3% of the 180-step constant-LR budget) appended after the banked matched-exposure landing, same stream/data order, LR factor (25 - k)/24 for cooldown step k (1.0 -> 1/24, never zero), both hybrid groups scaling equally; the corrected score is the post-cooldown calibration eval",
