      "text": "improvement inside the 0.0119 seed band (and/or no replication at the second seed) -> the conv is NOT the residual's owner on byte-LM text at probe scale; the uniformity attribution stands with one more receipt (a real possibility, stated BEFORE the result: the published with/without effects are heterogeneous, 0.05-13.5 ppl across the lineage, and ours may be at the small end)"
