      "text": "the fixed-shift control decomposes the conv's effect: ANY LOCAL MIXING (the shift arm's row) vs a LEARNED FILTER (the conv arm's row) -- no directional prediction is pre-stated for the decomposition; both rows are reported as measured against the composed machine's own and against each other"
