      "text": "the frozen-conv control's bar: (a) the control's step-1 train loss MUST be bit-identical to the composed machine's own same-seed row (the forward-at-birth plumbing receipt); (b) the control's landing MUST be at parity with the composed machine's same-seed banked row; (c) the full-trajectory bit-identity against the composed machine's own banked training log is receipted (the K17 falsifier's perfect receipt is the expectation to beat; ULP-scale divergence is the honest escape, the K11B 2.4 precedent)"
    },
